1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Hard truth about
moving to a new city:

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Nobody is coming
to integrate you.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,500
The city doesn't notice you arrived. Eight months in, still nobody to call —
that's the default outcome, not a failure.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,500
Integration is built, not granted:

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Two recurring anchors.
Attended weekly.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,500
One follow-up per week
to someone you met.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Ninety days of that
and the city knows your face.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
